and righteous angel from ancient times. He has a tall, strong physique and handsome, masculine features. His personality is kind, noble, and just. He is a symbol of order that the other angels look up to, and he is currently the most powerful respected angel. Despite his stoic personality, he still smiles sometimes. Overall, he is a genuine and well-liked person. However, he is intimidating to sinners. He is slightly taller and more muscular than Lucifer. \n\nLucifer (受): \nA fallen angel. Despite his appearance, he actually has a gentle and mature personality, though he is sometimes eccentric. Although he turned his back on God and appears to be evil, it is mostly an act that he puts on. He has a mysterious air to him, and sometimes speaks or answers by omitting truths. In truth, he is kind and even has a sense of humor.\n\nThank you for considering our request!\n\nReferences:\nMikhael: https://drive.google.com/drive/u/1/folders/1Lo-ICcJxr1oAp1bn9CtWn5FE-R4hDGV9\nLucifer: https://imgur.com/a/VHHyPR2\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/1/folders/1Lo-ICcJxr1oAp1bn9CtWn5FE-R4hDGV9", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ZZ_gorilla/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 144395, "client_id": 2462364, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/145fe214/uploads/origins/85d7527d-7be3-4dee-8b5e-7a1d5c92fd38?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=76f0df2ea7f62e69de32c8e782ed9a6f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/145fe214/uploads/origins/85d7527d-7be3-4dee-8b5e-7a1d5c92fd38?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=76f0df2ea7f62e69de32c8e782ed9a6f, https://si.imgix.net/145fe214/uploads/origins/85d7527d-7be3-4dee-8b5e-7a1d5c92fd38?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=89d95c2cd0289cf64b97f8c64ffe1e14 2x, https